Cosmetic shake is stronger at gentle contacts, lasts the configured duration (default 0.42 seconds), and blends recent pulses with bounded displacement/tilt. It preserves image aspect ratio and cannot alter the physics state. Resting contacts do not keep restarting it. This revision does not introduce random motion or forced rotation.

