Cosmetic sprite shake and its editor controls have been removed from the renderer. This applies to live play and offline video exports, including old projects with nonzero shake settings. Legacy fields remain readable for project compatibility and migrate to zero. Rotation, spin limits, wall corrections, merge growth, rings, glow and sparkles remain.

